OL,3,GNEWSA'He's always been by my side - now
OL,4,Ahe's given me his kidney'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSitting beside a dialysis machine on a
OL,7,Fbusy hospital ward, Fiona Hulbert is
OL,8,Fholding her husband Phil's hand
OL,9,Ftightly.
OL,11,FFiona, 55, is receiving the treatment
OL,12,Ffor the final time before she undergoes
OL,13,Ftransplant surgery the next day - and
OL,14,Fthe kidney donor is Phil.
OL,16,FThe couple, from Doncaster, have been
OL,17,Fmarried for 31 years, and they are
OL,18,Fabout to go through a challenging
OL,19,Fexperience that they hope will change
OL,20,Ftheir lives for the better.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
